---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: "Bryant Atelier is a Byron Bay film and content studio. Brand films, documentary, short-form content and ads for businesses from Byron Bay to the Gold Coast and the Northern Rivers. Get your free video plan."
preconnectVimeo: true
homeWork: ["flowing-wood", "convivio-kalio", "bytropic-nutrition"]
homeReels: [1, 3]
---

{# 1. HERO ------------------------------------------------------------- #}
<section class="hero" id="top" aria-label="Introduction">
  <div class="hero__media" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="hero__poster">{% picture "work/flowing-wood.jpg", "", "100vw", [800, 1280, 1920], { eager: true } %}</div>
    <div data-hero-video="{{ site.heroVimeo }}"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container hero__content">
    <h1>Film and video services for businesses that want to be seen.</h1>
    <p class="hero__sub"><strong class="hero__lead">Your one-stop creative workshop.</strong> Brand films, documentaries and <span class="nowrap">short-form</span> content for your website, socials&nbsp;and&nbsp;ads.</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.ctaUrl }}">{{ site.ctaLabel }} <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/work/">See the work</a>
    </div>
    {%- if site.google.rating %}
    <ul class="hero__chips" role="list">
      <li><span class="hero__label-caps"><span class="chip-stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span> {{ site.google.rating }} on Google</span><span class="serif">{% if site.google.reviewCount %}{{ site.google.reviewCount }} reviews{% else %}from our clients{% endif %}</span></li>
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}
    <p class="hero__text">{%- if site.portrait %}<span class="hero__avatar">{% picture "people/" + site.portrait, "", "40px", [80] %}</span>{% endif %}{% include "partials/text-alt.njk" %}</p>
  </div>
</section>

{# 2. CLIENT LOGOS ----------------------------------------------------- #}
{% include "partials/logo-strip.njk" %}

{# 3. SERVICES: "what can I get?" first, each card shows a still #}
<section class="section on-light services" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-h">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">01 / Services</span>
        <h2 id="services-h" style="margin-top: 1rem">Everything video, under one roof.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede muted">One studio for the whole job. {% draft %} From strategy and storytelling to filming and paid distribution, we run the full system so you stay focused on running your business.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="services__grid">
      <article class="service">
        <a class="service__media" href="/work/?type=documentary" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">{% picture "work/service-brand.jpg", "", "(min-width: 64rem) 30vw, 100vw", [480, 800] %}</a>
        <div class="service__body">
          <span class="pill">Tell your story</span>
          <h3>Brand Films &amp; Documentary</h3>
          <p class="service__text"><span class="col__lead">Cinematic anchors.</span> Hero films, campaign work, and founder portraits for soulful premium brands. Long-form storytelling and observational work for operators with stories worth holding. Films for retreats, lodges, hotels and venues, capturing the texture of a space and the people who hold it.</p>
          <ul class="service__tags" role="list"><li>Brand films</li><li>Founder portraits</li><li>Documentary</li><li>Place &amp; destination</li><li>Event documentary</li></ul>
          <a class="text-link" href="/work/?type=documentary">See the films <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="service">
        <a class="service__media" href="/work/?type=content-ads" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">{% picture "work/service-content.webp", "", "(min-width: 64rem) 30vw, 100vw", [480, 640] %}</a>
        <div class="service__body">
          <span class="pill">Show up every week</span>
          <h3>Monthly Content</h3>
          <p class="service__text">One shoot day a month. We turn it into a set of short-form pieces for social, all cut from the same footage. You show up every week, and it all looks like you. {% draft %}</p>
          <ul class="service__tags" role="list"><li>One shoot day a month</li><li>Short-form for social</li><li>Reels &amp; stories</li></ul>
          <a class="text-link" href="/work/?type=content-ads">See the content <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="service service--dark">
        <a class="service__media" href="/work/?type=content-ads" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">{% picture "work/service-ads.jpg", "", "(min-width: 64rem) 30vw, 100vw", [480, 800] %}</a>
        <div class="service__body">
          <span class="pill">Reach the right people</span>
          <h3>Ads &amp; Growth</h3>
          <p class="service__text">Every project starts with a clear plan. Great content only works if the right people see it. We run targeted paid distribution and lead capture systems that put your story in front of qualified prospects. We track what's working, refine what isn't, and continuously improve performance.</p>
          <p class="service__text" style="font-size: var(--fs-small)">We run the ads in-house, from strategy and creative through to distribution and optimisation. Need your funnel and website sorted too? We work alongside growth partner <a href="https://biggsgrowth.com.au" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Biggs Growth</a>. {% draft %}</p>
          <ul class="service__tags" role="list"><li>Strategy</li><li>Ad creative</li><li>Paid distribution</li><li>Optimisation</li></ul>
          <a class="text-link" href="/work/?type=content-ads">See the ads <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# 4. SELECTED WORK ---------------------------------------------------- #}
<section class="on-dark" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-h">
  <div class="container section work-head" style="padding-bottom: var(--space-lg)">
    <div class="section-head section-head--split" style="margin-bottom: 0">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">02 / Work</span>
        <h2 id="work-h" style="margin-top: 1rem">Selected films.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede muted">A few recent films. Brand work and documentary, often blended.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="work-feature">
      {%- for p in projects | bySlugs(homeWork) %}
      {% include "partials/work-tile.njk" %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="section-cta">
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/work/">See all work <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container section" style="padding-top: var(--space-xl)">
    <div class="split-reels">
        <div class="split-reels__text">
          <span class="eyebrow">Content &amp; Ads</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.4vw, 2.75rem); margin-top: 1rem">Visual stories that deliver results.</h3>
          <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 1rem; max-width: 30em">Short-form videos crafted to capture attention, build trust, and convert viewers into customers.</p>
          <div class="section-cta" style="margin-top: var(--space-md)">
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.ctaUrl }}">{{ site.ctaLabel }} <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
            {% include "partials/text-alt.njk" %}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="split-reels__media">
          {%- for r in reels %}{% if r.n in homeReels %}{% include "partials/reel-card.njk" %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# 4b. WHO WE HELP ------------------------------------------------- #}
<section class="section on-mist" id="who" aria-labelledby="who-h">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">03 / Who we help</span>
        <h2 id="who-h" style="margin-top: 1rem">Businesses ready to grow.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede muted">From local businesses and growing brands to founders, artists and not-for-profits.</p>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/industries.njk" %}
