      <p><strong>Don't see your business?</strong> Whether you're a founder, an artist or an individual with a project in mind, let's talk.</p>
      <div class="not-listed__actions">
        <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Tell us about your project <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# 6. CLIENT WINS / RECOGNITION. Every figure comes from the project write-ups. #}
