{# 8. ABOUT + WHY WORK WITH ME ------------------------------------------ #}
<section class="section on-light" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
  <div class="container about">
    {%- if site.portrait %}
    <figure class="about__photo">
      {% picture "people/" + site.portrait, "Joel Bryant, founder of Bryant Atelier, on the coast", "(min-width: 56rem) 40vw, 90vw", [480, 800, 1200] %}
      <figcaption class="about__photo-note"><span class="flag">[ADD 2 OR 3 MORE PHOTOS: on set, in the field, editing, for a collage like Jake's]</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
    {%- else %}
    <div class="photo-placeholder photo-placeholder--arch" role="img" aria-label="Photo of Joel Bryant to come">
      <span><span class="flag">[ADD PHOTO OF JOEL]</span><br><br>Portrait, 4:5, at least 1600px tall.<br>Two or three extra photos (on set, in the field) make a collage like Jake's.</span>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
    <div class="about__text">
      <span class="eyebrow">06 / Meet the filmmaker</span>
      <h2 id="about-h">Joel Bryant.</h2>
      <p class="about__pill"><strong>{{ site.experience.value }}</strong> {{ site.experience.label }}</p>
      <p>Bryant Atelier is led by Joel Bryant, a filmmaker and founder based in Byron Bay. {% draft %}</p>
      <p>It brings two studios under one roof: Lineage Films for brand films and documentary, and Convert Studios for content and ads. {% draft %}</p>
      <p>Joel directs, shoots and edits much of the work himself, from solo documentary shoots on remote coastline to campaign days with a small crew. And we run the ads in-house. {% draft %}</p>
      <p class="about__pull">We come from a filmmaking background, which means we treat every piece of work as a story worth watching. That's the standard. The business outcomes follow.</p>
      <p class="muted"><span class="flag">[ADD: why you started, and something about you outside work]</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container" style="margin-top: var(--space-xl)">
    <h3 class="why__title">Why work with us {% draft %}</h3>
    <ul class="why" role="list">
      <li><strong>You work with Joel</strong><span>The person who films it is the person who edits it. No account managers, no hand-offs.</span></li>
      <li><strong>Story first</strong><span>Every project starts with the story, not the camera.</span></li>
      <li><strong>Award-winning</strong><span>Best Byron Bay Film, Byron Bay International Film Festival 2025.</span></li>
      <li><strong>One shoot, every format</strong><span>A hero film, social cuts and stills from the same days.</span></li>
      <li><strong>Content and ads together</strong><span>We make the content and run the ads, so nothing gets lost between them.</span></li>
      <li><strong>Local</strong><span>Based in Byron Bay, working from the Northern Rivers to the Gold Coast.</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{# 5. HOW WE WORK (Lineage's Develop / Direct / Distribute, with the free step first) #}
<section class="section on-dark how" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-h">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">07 / How we work</span>
        <h2 id="approach-h" style="margin-top: 1rem">How we work.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede muted">One shoot. A hero film, a month of social content and the ads that carry it, all from the same footage. {% draft %}</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps" role="list">
      <li class="step">
        <span class="step__num">01</span>
        <h3>Start free</h3>
        <p class="step__sub">Your free video plan</p>
        <p class="step__body">We study your business and send you a plan: your story, 3 ideas to shoot, what others in your industry do well, and what to fix. Within 2 business days. {% draft %}</p>
        <p class="step__get"><span>You get</span>Clear ideas, even if we don't work together {% draft %}</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <span class="step__num">02</span>
        <h3>Develop</h3>
        <p class="step__sub">Plan the story</p>
        <p class="step__body">Story development, treatment, casting, scheduling and campaign strategy. The decisions made before a camera rolls shape everything that follows.</p>
        <p class="step__get"><span>You get</span>A treatment, a shot list and a plan {% draft %}</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <span class="step__num">03</span>
        <h3>Direct</h3>
        <p class="step__sub">Shoot and edit</p>
        <p class="step__body">Direction, cinematography, sound and lighting through to editing, colour and sound design. Embedded with the work, end to end.</p>
        <p class="step__get"><span>You get</span>A hero film and a library of footage {% draft %}</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step step--light">
        <span class="step__num">04</span>
        <h3>Distribute</h3>
        <p class="step__sub">Cut, post and promote</p>
        <p class="step__body">Cut-downs, formats, content optimisation, community engagement and ongoing repurposing: the long tail that compounds.</p>
        <p class="step__get"><span>You get</span>Social content and ads that keep working {% draft %}</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="steps__note">On Monthly Content, steps 2 to 4 repeat every month. {% draft %}</p>
  </div>
</section>

